#: docs/guides/provider-porting.md:9
msgid "Extend the STM32F4 support package"
msgstr "扩展 STM32F4 支持包"

#: docs/guides/provider-porting.md:16
msgid ""
"Read the [integration contract](../design/integration-contracts.md), "
"[official-library boundary](../design/official-stm32-provider.md#build-time-"
"provider-contract) and [exact support](../delivery/support.md) first."
msgstr ""
"先阅读[接入合同](../design/integration-contracts.md)、[官方库边界](../design/official-"
"stm32-provider.md#build-time-provider-"
"contract)和[精确支持](../delivery/support.md)。"

#: docs/guides/provider-porting.md:20
msgid "Choose the smallest real change"
msgstr "选择最小的真实变更"

#: docs/guides/provider-porting.md:0
msgid "Change"
msgstr "变更"

#: docs/guides/provider-porting.md:0
msgid "Required work"
msgstr "必要工作"

#: docs/guides/provider-porting.md:0
msgid "Same-part Board"
msgstr "相同芯片的新 Board"

#: docs/guides/provider-porting.md:0
msgid "Supply reviewed PCB facts and select existing routes"
msgstr "提供受审 PCB 事实并选择已有路线"

#: docs/guides/provider-porting.md:0
msgid "New exact F4 part"
msgstr "新精确 F4 型号"

#: docs/guides/provider-porting.md:0
msgid ""
"Add device/part/package/memory/startup facts and validate the actual hardware"
" profile"
msgstr "补充器件、料号、封装、内存、启动事实，验证实际硬件 profile"

#: docs/guides/provider-porting.md:0
msgid "Additional route"
msgstr "新增路线"

#: docs/guides/provider-porting.md:0
msgid "Verify AF, DMA, IRQ, conflicts and electrical constraints"
msgstr "核对 AF、DMA、IRQ、冲突和电气约束"

#: docs/guides/provider-porting.md:0
msgid "New hardware behavior"
msgstr "新硬件行为"

#: docs/guides/provider-porting.md:0
msgid "Implement C and meaningful contract tests; extend only necessary schema"
msgstr "实现 C 与有意义的合同测试，仅扩展必要 schema"

#: docs/guides/provider-porting.md:0
msgid "External device"
msgstr "外部器件"

#: docs/guides/provider-porting.md:0
msgid "Use public typed ports from an optional component"
msgstr "通过可选组件使用公共类型化端口"

#: docs/guides/provider-porting.md:30
msgid ""
"Reusable private IP sources belong inside the F4 package. The [ownership "
"diagram](../assets/diagrams/driver-source-ownership.svg) distinguishes source"
" selection from runtime calls; it does not add another dispatch layer."
msgstr ""
"可复用的私有 IP 源码归入 F4 包。[归属图](../assets/diagrams/driver-source-"
"ownership.svg)区分源码选编与运行调用，不增加另一层分派。"

#: docs/guides/provider-porting.md:34
msgid "Implement and bind"
msgstr "实现与绑定"

#: docs/guides/provider-porting.md:36
msgid ""
"Fix the official SDK revision and exact manual/datasheet/errata sources."
msgstr "固定官方 SDK revision，以及精确手册、数据手册和勘误来源。"

#: docs/guides/provider-porting.md:37
msgid ""
"Describe exact facts without C expressions, register scripts or executable "
"family plugins. Keep Board wiring separate from silicon capabilities."
msgstr "描述精确事实，不放入 C 表达式、寄存器脚本或可执行系列插件。Board 接线与芯片能力分开。"

#: docs/guides/provider-porting.md:39
msgid ""
"Reuse the reviewed HAL/LL path, or document the exact reason for a private "
"algorithm. Keep vendor Handles private and one transport owner per domain."
msgstr "复用受审 HAL／LL 路径，或记录私有算法的具体原因。厂商 Handle 保持私有，每个行为域只有一个 transport owner。"

#: docs/guides/provider-porting.md:41
msgid ""
"Add actual C admission, acquire, stop and partial-failure cleanup. A failed "
"current step may already own hardware effects and must retain its receipt."
msgstr "补充实际 C 准入、取得、停止和部分失败清理。当前步骤失败时可能已产生硬件效果，必须保留其收条。"

#: docs/guides/provider-porting.md:43
msgid ""
"Generate only selected static configuration, storage, faces and connections. "
"Factory lookup returns existing objects and does not initialize hardware."
msgstr "仅生成选中的静态配置、存储、face 与连接。factory 查询返回已有对象，不初始化硬件。"

#: docs/guides/provider-porting.md:45
msgid ""
"Select sources in CMake and reject unsupported parts, modes or resource "
"combinations before firmware generation."
msgstr "在 CMake 中选编源码，在生成固件前拒绝未支持的型号、模式或资源组合。"

#: docs/guides/provider-porting.md:48
msgid "Validate the complete contract"
msgstr "验证完整合同"

#: docs/guides/provider-porting.md:50
msgid ""
"Execute actual RED before production behavior changes, then GREEN with "
"GoogleTest/GoogleMock for C contracts. Exercise rejection, multiple "
"instances, partial initialization, cancel, deadline, late IRQ, failed "
"withdrawal and retained borrows as applicable. Mock external ports, not a "
"replacement implementation."
msgstr ""
"修改生产行为前执行真实 RED，再使用 GoogleTest／GoogleMock 取得 C 合同 "
"GREEN。按适用范围覆盖拒绝、多实例、部分初始化、取消、deadline、迟到 IRQ、撤回失败和保留借用。mock 外部端口，不替换生产实现。"

#: docs/guides/provider-porting.md:55
msgid ""
"Compile and link the exact part/mode with its real compiler flags, startup, "
"geometry and memory constraints. Check unused-mode elimination and actual "
"resource costs. A host model, header compile or SDK macro is not physical "
"qualification; station execution remains separate and currently not executed."
msgstr ""
"使用真实编译选项、启动、几何和内存约束，编译并链接精确型号与模式。核对未用模式裁剪和实际资源成本。主机模型、头文件编译或 SDK "
"宏均不是物理资格；station 执行独立且当前未执行。"

#: docs/guides/provider-porting.md:60
msgid ""
"Update current documentation and translations with the implementation. "
"Historical cross-family integration is available from [the fixed prior "
"source](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/tree/8e147fc2c812d81ab6596e0d1a6bc8908d30ac18) and does not define "
"the new production catalogue."
msgstr ""
"随实现更新当前文档和翻译。历史跨系列接入可从[固定旧源码](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/tree/8e147fc2c812d81ab6596e0d1a6bc8908d30ac18)追溯，不定义新的生产支持目录。"

msgid "References select the explicit `es0182-rev19` software-audit profile. The central `reference_profiles.py` owns the locked document identity and applicability table without importing a hardware provider. This is host build code, not a Board/SoC Python plugin or firmware register script. A profile name, catalog entry or header compile does not qualify another part, an implemented erratum workaround or physical hardware."
msgstr "资料显式选择 `es0182-rev19` 软件审计 profile。中央 `reference_profiles.py` 直接维护锁定的文档身份和适用表，不导入硬件 provider。这是主机构建代码，不是 Board／SoC Python 插件或固件寄存器脚本。profile 名称、目录项或头文件编译不建立其他料号、已实现勘误方案或物理硬件资格。"

msgid "Use this guide to add an exact F4 part, reviewed route or concrete mode. Current production ownership is one F4 package; the [support catalogue](../delivery/support.md) distinguishes reviewed part facts, F407 Boards and internal-CRC software references. Do not create a parallel driver set for each part or infer support from similar register names."
msgstr "本指南用于增加精确 F4 料号、已审路线或具体模式。生产源码归于一个 F4 包；[支持目录](../delivery/support.md)区分已审器件事实、F407 Board 与内部 CRC 软件参考。不要为每颗料号建立平行驱动集，也不要从相似寄存器名推定支持。"

msgid "The current catalog-backed F4 facts select exactly one `device_profiles.<device>` through `variants.<part>.device`, then compose disjoint `controller_groups` with separate physical `controllers` and maintained software `modes`. The immutable `DeviceView` keeps `ControllerFacts` and `ControllerModes` distinct. Reuse `resolve_device_facts` for resolution, support queries and derived matrices. Common F405/407/415/417 facts are shared, while only F407/417 select ETH/DCMI; package, memory and bonded-pad intersections remain exact. A Host-only all-device index supports route auditing; never use its union for admission, generation or firmware storage. A derived family display does not authorize another part."
msgstr "当前 F4 事实由 `variants.<part>.device` 选择唯一 `device_profiles.<device>`，再组合不重叠的 `controller_groups`；物理 `controllers` 与软件 `modes` 分开。不可变 `DeviceView` 区分 `ControllerFacts` 和 `ControllerModes`，解析、支持查询和派生矩阵复用 `resolve_device_facts`。F405／407／415／417 共用已审共同事实，只有 F407／417 选择 ETH／DCMI；封装、内存和实际引脚交集仍精确检查。仅主机侧的全器件索引用于路线审计，不得将其并集用于准入、生成或固件存储。派生家族展示不授权其他料号。"
